          "title": "Markdraw Canvas · architecture.markdraw",
          "body": "{\"_ui\":\"markdraw\",\"key\":\"markdraw-canvas-2\",\"title\":\"Markdraw Canvas \\u00B7 architecture.markdraw\",\"activeDocument\":\"/work/architecture.markdraw\",\"format\":\"markdraw\",\"content\":\"# IntoChat Neuron \\u0026 Data Architecture\\n\\nInteractive \\u0060.markdraw\\u0060 canvas shared between you and **Ino**. Draw freely on the canvas or ask Ino to add nodes, connect arrows, or diagram any dataset.\\n\\n\\u0060\\u0060\\u0060markdraw\\n@background #0f172a\\n@grid 20\\nframe \\u0022DigitalBrain OS \\u00B7 Live Co-Drawing Canvas\\u0022 id=os-frame at 40,40 size 880x440\\nrect \\u0022Ino Assistant (apps/ino)\\u0022 id=ino-agent at 80,110 size 220x80 fill=#1e1b4b color=#818cf8 rounded=12\\nrect \\u0022Files VFS (/work/*)\\u0022 id=files-vfs at 370,110 size 210x80 fill=#064e3b color=#34d399 rounded=12\\nrect \\u0022Data Analytics Engine\\u0022 id=data-engine at 650,110 size 220x80 fill=#1e3a8a color=#60a5fa rounded=12\\nrect \\u0022Markdraw Studio (apps/markdraw)\\u0022 id=markdraw-studio at 220,280 size 240x84 fill=#065f46 color=#10b981 rounded=12\\ndiamond \\u0022Interactive Charts \\u0026 Tables\\u0022 id=chart-view at 560,280 size 230x84 fill=#3b0764 color=#c084fc\\narrow ino-agent -\\u003E files-vfs \\u0022Read / Write VFS\\u0022 color=#34d399\\narrow files-vfs -\\u003E data-engine \\u0022CSV / JSON / SQL\\u0022 color=#60a5fa\\narrow ino-agent -\\u003E markdraw-studio \\u0022patch-elements\\u0022 color=#10b981\\narrow data-engine -\\u003E chart-view \\u0022Visualize\\u0022 color=#c084fc\\narrow data-engine -\\u003E markdraw-studio \\u0022from-data\\u0022 color=#38bdf8\\nrect \\u0022Redis Cache\\u0022 id=redis-cache at 650,410 size 220x76 fill=#7f1d1d color=#f87171 rounded=10\\narrow data-engine -\\u003E redis-cache \\u0022Sub-ms Cache\\u0022 color=#f87171\\n\\u0060\\u0060\\u0060\",\"revision\":2,\"status\":\"Exported 13 element(s) to /work/architecture.excalidraw (excalidraw)\",\"lastExportPath\":\"/work/architecture.excalidraw\",\"height\":560,\"workspaceDrawings\":[\"/work/architecture.markdraw\",\"/work/pipeline-flow.markdraw\"],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"os-frame\",\"kind\":\"frame\",\"label\":\"DigitalBrain OS \\u00B7 Live Co-Drawing Canvas\",\"x\":80,\"y\":250,\"width\":840,\"height\":400,\"fromId\":null,\"toId\":null,\"color\":\"#10b981\"},{\"id\":\"ino-agent\",\"kind\":\"rect\",\"label\":\"Ino Assistant (apps/ino)\",\"x\":340,\"y\":250,\"width\":210,\"height\":80,\"fromId\":null,\"toId\":null,\"color\":\"#818cf8\"},{\"id\":\"files-vfs\",\"kind\":\"rect\",\"label\":\"Files VFS (/work/*)\",\"x\":600,\"y\":250,\"width\":210,\"height\":80,\"fromId\":null,\"toId\":null,\"color\":\"#34d399\"},{\"id\":\"data-engine\",\"kind\":\"rect\",\"label\":\"Data Analytics Engine\",\"x\":80,\"y\":390,\"width\":210,\"height\":80,\"fromId\":null,\"toId\":null,\"color\":\"#60a5fa\"},{\"id\":\"markdraw-studio\",\"kind\":\"rect\",\"label\":\"Markdraw Studio (apps/markdraw)\",\"x\":340,\"y\":390,\"width\":210,\"height\":80,\"fromId\":null,\"toId\":null,\"color\":\"#10b981\"},{\"id\":\"chart-view\",\"kind\":\"diamond\",\"label\":\"Interactive Charts \\u0026 Tables\",\"x\":600,\"y\":390,\"width\":210,\"height\":80,\"fromId\":null,\"toId\":null,\"color\":\"#c084fc\"},{\"id\":\"arrow-ino-agent-files-vfs\",\"kind\":\"arrow\",\"label\":\"Read / Write VFS\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":0,\"height\":0,\"fromId\":\"ino-agent\",\"toId\":\"files-vfs\",\"color\":\"#34d399\"},{\"id\":\"arrow-files-vfs-data-engine\",\"kind\":\"arrow\",\"label\":\"CSV / JSON / SQL\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":0,\"height\":0,\"fromId\":\"files-vfs\",\"toId\":\"data-engine\",\"color\":\"#60a5fa\"},{\"id\":\"arrow-ino-agent-markdraw-studio\",\"kind\":\"arrow\",\"label\":\"patch-elements\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":0,\"height\":0,\"fromId\":\"ino-agent\",\"toId\":\"markdraw-studio\",\"color\":\"#10b981\"},{\"id\":\"arrow-data-engine-chart-view\",\"kind\":\"arrow\",\"label\":\"Visualize\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"width\":0,\"height\":0,\"fromId\":\"data-engine\"